    "label": "43",
    "prompt": "Solve the following equation.\n$$4^x-5(2^x)+4=0.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=0$ or $x=2$.",
      "worked": "Let $u=2^x>0$, so $4^x=u^2$.\n$$\\begin{align*}u^2-5u+4&=0\\\\(u-1)(u-4)&=0\\\\u&=1\\text{ or }u=4\\\\2^x&=2^0\\text{ or }2^x=2^2\\\\x&=0\\text{ or }x=2.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
